{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜で握手会！ありがとうありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-18.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から貧血気味で顔に血の気がなかったのでそれを補うように真っ赤なジャケットを羽織りました\nそれだと暑いのでへそをだしましたが恥ずかしかったので頑張って隠しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0001-18.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"倉庫..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クレープ屋さんとコーヒー屋さんが差し入れで来てくれました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0002-14.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0003-11.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいの握手会が最後だったということでセレモニーがあって写真やムービー撮ったぞ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん人が待っててくれていたから写真におさめようと初めてパノラマ機能使ったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0004-5.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時空が歪んでマネージャーきくちさんがすごいことになったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近おめでたい知らせが多くて嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたははやいのでねるぞ！おやすみなさい"}],"source":"archive"}